// Reference lists for the CARF validator, read from the OECD schema itself
// (isocarftypes_v1.1.xsd: simpleType CountryCode_Type, 250 codes, and currCode_Type,
// 186 codes), 24.11.2026. These are exactly the values the schema accepts,
// so a code outside them fails the BZSt's schema check. Comparison is
// case-sensitive, as the schema's is. Regenerate from the XSD, do not edit by hand.

